# Legacy seed data — real staff names, emails, phone numbers and salaries.
# Excluded because this repository is public, and because a phone number is the
# login credential in this app: publishing one tells anyone which number to
# request an OTP for. These files are only the input to the one-time JSON→Postgres
# migration (backend/db/seed.js); db/seed-users.js is the supported way to
# bootstrap an install, and it uses placeholder numbers.
backend/data/*.json

# typescript
*.tsbuildinfo

# generated native folders
/ios
/android
